# External side-effect confirm (kit)

**Full procedure:** skill `external-side-effect-confirm`.

Before any CONFIRM-REQUIRED action (ASP crawl, Ads/Sheets write, Slack/GChat/Airbrake,
`docker build` that RUNs OCV jobs, `gh workflow run`, Thira deploy/reg-suit S3,
`db:drop`/`db:reset`, prod credentials): print the confirm block and **wait** for
`OK` / `confirm` / `được` in the user reply. Do not run on implied consent.

**OCV caveat:** `DRY_RUN=1` ≠ offline — crawlers still hit ASP. Prefer
`DISABLE_NOTIFICATIONS=1` / empty webhooks when user has not allowed alerts.
